  "body": "Experience the perfect fusion of modern, effortless comfort in this single-level masterpiece house and land package. Tailor-made for families who value both style and connection.\r\n\r\nWake up to sun-drenched mornings in the north-facing living and dining area – your personal haven for laughter, celebration, and quiet moments alike. Imagine golden sunlight pouring through your window, illuminating a seamless open-plan space where memories are made and every meal feels special.\r\n\r\nThe designer kitchen is a culinary showpiece, crafted for the passionate home chef and the entertainer at heart. Sleek surfaces, generous storage, and contemporary finishes make every moment in the kitchen a delight.\r\n\r\nRetreat to the serene master bedroom – your own private sanctuary – while three additional bedrooms provide ample space for family, guests, or a home office.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the practicality of a single internal-access garage, adding security and ease to your daily routine.\r\n\r\nNestled in sought-after Ara Hills, you're moments from stunning landscapes, local cafés, Redwood Park, shops, schools. Easy access to motorway. And with Orewa Beach just a short drive away, all the amenities that make Orewa living so desirable.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your exclusive viewing – don't let this rare opportunity slip away.",
